    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf What is Midnight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Midnight is a precision-based physics puzzle platformer where you launch a square-shaped fairy through 56 deadly accurate levels \u2014 using only your mouse. Dodge traps, teleporters, saws, and spikes with careful aim and sharp reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd79 Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Mouse-based aiming and launch physics  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 56 levels with increasing difficulty  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A relaxing ambient soundtrack  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Steam Trading Cards   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Controller support via Steam Input</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoy minimalist yet challenging gameplay, Midnight offers the perfect short-form experience \u2014 easy to pick up, impossible to put down.</p>",
